      "titleZh": "为什么专业化不可避免",
      "titleEn": "Why Specialization Is Inevitable",
      "summaryZh": "Hugging Face 发布了一篇关于 AI 模型专业化趋势的文章，认为随着模型数量激增，通用模型将让位于针对特定任务优化的专业模型。",
      "summaryEn": "Hugging Face published an article arguing that as the number of models explodes, general-purpose models will give way to specialized models optimized for specific tasks.",
      "keywords": [
        "专业化",
        "通用模型",
        "趋势"
      ],
